{"blocks":[{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/miria.watanabe/img/miria.watanabe/img/2015/05/30/8200212/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"握手会ありがとうございました。\n嬉しい事に列が途切れずで楽しく\n皆さんとお話出来ました(Ｔ▽Ｔ)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"3部がふわゆる巻き\n4部がポニーテール！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ポニーテールが好評で嬉しかった✨"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"スムージー屋さんが来てて興奮しました\n(*ﾟ∀ﾟ*)ﾑｯﾊｰ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちなみにマンゴーとグアバ！美味！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"6月7日に来る方も宜しくお願いします♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/miria.watanabe/img/miria.watanabe/img/2015/05/30/8200212/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"....................................."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こないだの乃木坂工事中で\n玲奈さんがグルメ漫画について\nお話されてたのですが、\n実は私も好きで(((^-^)))"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ワカコ酒といつかティファニーで朝食を\nを今は同時読みしてる"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"『ワカコ酒』はお酒と食べ物の話だけど\nお酒飲めない未成年でも\n楽しく読めるの♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"『いつかティファニーで朝食を』は\n実際にそのお店が実在するから\n今度行ってみようかなって\n思ってるの！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/miria.watanabe/img/miria.watanabe/img/2015/05/30/8200212/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"金曜ロードショー観ましたか？\nハリーポッター4週連続！！\nポッタリアンとしては歓喜(Ｔ▽Ｔ)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私は本より映画派です。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みりり委員会"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/miria.watanabe/img/miria.watanabe/img/2015/05/30/8200212/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"前回と前々回同じ写真を\n載せてしまってごめんなさい\n教えてくれた方ありがとう"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"誕生日〜5月編〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/miria.watanabe/img/miria.watanabe/img/2015/05/30/8200212/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/miria.watanabe/img/miria.watanabe/img/2015/05/30/8200212/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"日村さん\nお誕生日おめでとうございます！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"『写真で一言』"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今回の写真で一言はこれ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/miria.watanabe/img/miria.watanabe/img/2015/05/30/8200212/0006.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私達○○です。とか\n服について突っ込んだりとか\n後ろの壁とか背景とか突っ込むと\n面白そう！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"毎回難しいよね...\n簡単な写真探してきます。。（笑）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"『前回の写真で一言』"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私がいいなぁと思った方を\n紹介していきます。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"No.50 しんいけ さん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"非常食のうどん指に巻いておきますね"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"No.78 ぷにしょー さん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"齋藤飛鳥さーーーーん((((；ﾟДﾟ)))))))\nお金がないので婚約指輪は\nポテコでいいですか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"No.95 ボン！ さん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"うふふ、えへへ、うーんこれ\n抜けないパターンのやつだね〜(苦笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"No.97 柘榴 さん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あすかてゃんの小指の第二関節が\n特に可愛いね"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"No.136 のんた さん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"み「これどうぞ！(指にはめる)」\nあ「え？これポテコ？わたしなげわ派なんだけどw」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"No.137 悠人@OLBBA推し さん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"カブト虫の幼虫見つけたから\nとりあえず薬指にはめとくね"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"No.144 らぃち⊿みりり委員会No.2117 さん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それより飛鳥さん、小指が\nイッツアスモールワールドですね"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"No.157 じょう さん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ねぇねぇ笑ってるけど、関節技\n決まってるよ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"No.175 たくや⊿ さん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この指輪は心の清い人にしか見えません！\nよって飛鳥さんは見えま..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"No.274 まつばーら さん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"み「見て見てこの爪の剛毛」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"No.303 中田推しジャーキー さん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お分かりだろうか\nみり愛と飛鳥の間にうっすらと\n人の目が写っていることを..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"No.418 こーすけ さん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"指輪をプレゼントするために\nさりげなくカールをはめて\n指のサイズをはかる"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"No.550 42だら さん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"第二関節通すのに2時間かかりました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"No.703 ゆうひこ さん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"飛鳥さんこれ46秒後に爆発します♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"No.713 おむおむすびらんど さん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"世界一安い結婚指輪！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"皆様ありがとう！\n今回の写真で一言も待ってます(((^-^)))"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/miria.watanabe/img/miria.watanabe/img/2015/05/30/8200212/0007.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"また見てね"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みり愛"}],"source":"archive"}